  "description": "Steelhead – The Ultimate Adventure Tandem\nInspired by the native Steelhead fish of the Pacific Northwest, this tandem is built for adventure on any road—whether it’s paved, double track, or gravel-covered. Designed for versatility, the Steelhead Tandem is the perfect companion for weekend explorations, endurance races like the Land Run 100 and Belgian Waffle Ride, or long-distance Gran Fondo events. With its light yet rugged steel frame, it offers a smooth, responsive ride no matter the terrain and complete control over the bike(no twist or bend in the frame under pressure).\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 32-45mm tires for all-road capability\n\nExclusive Reynolds 631 air-hardened steel frame for strength and performance\n\nTapered head tube with Co-Motion 1.5” TA carbon fork for precision handling\n\nDisc brakes and hydraulic-ready cable routing for superior stopping power\n\nRack & fender mounts for touring and adventure flexibility\n\nCNC-machined chainstay yoke for added durability and stiffness\n\nBoost 148x12mm and 110x15mm TA dropouts for stability and wheel compatibility\n\nInternal Di2 wiring ports & Hydro brake mounts for a clean, modern setup\n\nFrom gravel adventures to high-speed endurance rides, the Steelhead Tandem is engineered to handle it all. Get ready to explore new roads and push your limits!",
